,"document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064404006:0":{"text":"陣形を崩すな！訓練どおりに動くのだ！\n矢に火をつけよ！","source_cn":"稳住阵线！记住演练内容！\\n箭矢上弦，火油准备，等待我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07A9FB0C38CAC9C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064404007:0":{"text":"事前の備えが功を奏し、兵士たちは束の間の動揺からすぐに立ち直ると、各自の持ち場へ散っていった。","source_cn":"得益于提前部署，士兵们很快从短暂的惊愕中回过神来，有条...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D26546D9037224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064404008:0":{"text":"やがて、闇の波の輪郭が徐々に浮かび上がる。それは異形の人型魔物で構成された大軍だった。魔物たちは城壁へ辿り着くや否や、一斉によじ登り始めた。","source_cn":"黑暗浪潮的轮廓终于清晰：那是由形态扭曲的类人形生物组成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B2E3913E3C7101","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064404009:0":{"text":"放て！\n下等種どもを焼き払うのだ！","source_cn":"放箭！\\n让这些杂碎在雪中淬火！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDDFEEDDCD3CA301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064404010:0":{"text":"火矢が放たれ、魔物たちの足元に撒かれた油へ次々と突き刺さる。燃え上がる炎が雪夜を照らし、耳をつんざくような悲鳴が響き渡った。","source_cn":"火箭离弦，准确地扎入魔物脚下的火油中，火焰升腾，雪夜中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF9213CC44F9B601","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064404011:0":{"text":"最初の突撃は食い止めた。だが、魔物の軍勢はなおも圧倒的だった。降り注ぐ矢をものともせず、凍てつく城壁をよじ登ってくる。","source_cn":"第一波冲击受挫，但魔物的数量依然惊人。它们顶着箭雨，继...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA530BA48BE6C1E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064404012:0":{"text":"岩を落とせ！\n猪だろうが魔物だろうが、砕けぬ骨などない！","source_cn":"推石！\\n我不信他们的骨头比野猪还硬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656246149035B56B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064404013:0":{"text":"巨大な落石が魔物たちを次々と叩き落とす。それでも魔物は恐怖を知らぬかのように、倒れた同胞の骸を踏み越え、なおも城へ迫り続けた――","source_cn":"巨型滚石将城墙上的魔物砸倒，但它们似乎不会感到恐惧，踩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9D6704BDB06A297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064404014:0":{"text":"戦いは幾時間にも及んでいた。吹雪が荒れ狂い、無数の屍が積み重なり、極寒の北地で巨大な氷塊と化していく。","source_cn":"战斗持续了数小时，风雪呼号，数不尽的尸骸堆叠，在极寒的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C043F2C5C26D1F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064404015:0":{"text":"やがて、魔物の第一波がようやく退いた。兵士たちの表情には、なおも拭いきれない動揺が残る。それでも彼らの瞳には、生き延びた者だけに宿る確かな光があった。","source_cn":"魔物的第一波攻势终于退去，许多士兵挂着惊魂未定的神情，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73225AA3B726C1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064404016:0":{"text":"か、勝った……サバス城を守り抜いたぞ！","source_cn":"我们、我们赢了！安息城守住了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E6F1BAE0B2F3EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064404017:0":{"text":"気を緩めるな！これはただの前哨戦、本当の嵐はこれからだ！","source_cn":"冷静！这只是一次试探，真正的风暴尚未到来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CA434D83DF3CBA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064404018:0":{"text":"死傷者を確認し、矢と投石を補充せよ。全員、警戒を怠るな！","source_cn":"清点伤亡，补充箭矢滚石。所有人，保持警惕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD8C3A941C8E821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064404019:0":{"text":"はっ！","source_cn":"是！将军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E3E24245682F01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:33:1064404020:0":{"text":"それから三日間、サバス城は血色の嵐に呑み込まれる……","source_cn":"接下来三天，安息城陷入血色风暴中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D91DBA085FF4D4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064404021:0":{"tex