"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064404026:0":{"text":"アルナは拳を城壁に叩きつけた。そこへ追い打ちをかけるように、魔物を遥かに凌ぐ知性と力を持つ、カタストロフ総帥の声が城外に響き渡った。","source_cn":"阿尔娜愤然锤向城墙，更绝望的是，城外传来声音，它来自比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F91B41EF699E148","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064404027:0":{"text":"脆き虫けらどもよ、深淵の意志に耳を傾けるのだ！\n明日、総攻撃を開始する！貴様らの城は瓦礫と化し、生ある者は一人残らず引き裂いてくれよう！","source_cn":"脆弱的蝼蚁，聆听深渊的意志！\\n明日，总攻开始！我将踏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF815E7BBE194D1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064404028:0":{"text":"だが慈悲深き深淵は、貴様らに一つ選択肢を与えてやる――直ちに開城し、跪いて服従せよ！さすれば、命だけは助けてやろう。","source_cn":"但，仁慈的深渊，给予你们一个选择——立刻打开城门，跪地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911CF8729329F6BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064404029:1":{"text":"アルナは背後の兵士を見渡す。武器を握り締め沈黙する者、静かに悪態をつく者。それでも誰一人、隊列を乱す者はいなかった。","source_cn":"阿尔娜望向身后，有人沉默地握紧武器，有人低声咒骂，但队...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73E6EBBCFBBC0678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064404030:1":{"text":"兵士たち、見事だ！\n今夜も、明日も、その先一刻たりとも、サバス城は決して陥ちぬ！","source_cn":"好样的，士兵们！\\n今夜，明日，每一刻，安息城，永不陷落！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B97636BC2F186C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064404031:1":{"text":"我らの手で、カタストロフとその下等種どもを、深淵へ送り返してくれようぞ！","source_cn":"与我一起，把恶魔和它的渣滓们送回深渊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7186C780B65A20CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064404032:0":{"text":"だがアルナは悟っていた。兵士の不屈の意志だけでは、この戦いに勝てないと……彼女は副官に指揮を託すと、自ら領主のもとへ向かった。","source_cn":"阿尔娜明白，仅靠军队顽强的意志，不足以赢得战争。她安排...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE350424812AAEA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064404033:0":{"text":"スノーはどこだ！？","source_cn":"斯诺，他在哪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x887CE278F3CFB68B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064404034:0":{"text":"アルナ将軍……領主様は城のことを案じるあまり、ご体調を崩されました。恐れ入りますが、お取り次ぎしかねます。","source_cn":"阿尔娜将军，领主大人忧心城防，以致身体欠安，现在不便打扰呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427CD9947B0C5634","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064404035:0":{"text":"貴様の詭弁に付き合ってる暇はない！\n兵士は今も血を流している。さっさと物資を回せ！","source_cn":"我没有时间与你玩弄唇舌！\\n士兵在流血，我需要物资援助！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6254B7D211FE9C75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064404036:0":{"text":"そ、そもそも……この戦いは将軍様の独断ですよね。領主様の財を、易々と無駄にはできません……","source_cn":"您此前一意孤行，物资派遣自然得多加考量，领主大人的财富...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9185C5B5C7F0CD6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064404037:0":{"text":"はあっ！","source_cn":"喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1044024D1A358595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064404038:1":{"text":"アルナは槍に付いた血を拭い、ピントスの亡骸を越えて城の奥へと進んだ。","source_cn":"阿尔娜抹去枪上的鲜血，迈过平图斯的尸体，走向城堡深处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB7269A491AB4A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1064404039:0":{"text":"だが、城内のどこにも領主の姿は見当たらない。残される可能性は城外へ通じる隠し通路。その入り口は崩れた岩で完全に塞がれていた。","source_cn":"城堡各处不见领主踪影，只有一条通往城外的密道，此时已被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A98C0FB2AAC163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064404040:0":{"text":"微かに漂う火薬の匂い。どうやら追跡を防ぐため、自ら爆破したようだ。","source_cn":"看来，为了防止追击，领主在逃跑后已将地道炸毁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ACE371C0C149FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064404041:0":{"text":"そなた、財物庫へ案内せよ！","source_cn":"你，带我去财库！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x054D1DBD977F3999","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064404042:0":{"text":"領主様……いえ、スノーは……財物庫の中身をすべて持ち出し、逃走しました！","source_cn":"领主大人……不不，斯诺他、他在逃跑时，已经将财库搬空了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC12C77EB4CC4E727","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064404043:0":{"text":"アズールアイスも、か？","source_cn":"连同冰蓝晶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF47AE9DFC68CEC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064404044:1":{"text":"は、はい……運び出せなかった物資は、すべて焼き払えと……どうか、命だけは……！","source_cn":"是、是的……带不走的物资，他命令我们全部烧掉……求大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA4A2E6107D43A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064404045:0":{"text":"恥を知れ！\nそのような怯えが、サバス城を滅ぼすのだ。それでも戦士か！","source_cn":"耻辱！\\n你们的胆怯，会摧毁安息城！愧为战士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x403F9EC1E58C4CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064404046:0":{"text":"アルナは跪いて命乞いする守衛に一瞥もくれず、ただ領主逃亡の事実を伏せるよう命じて戦線へと戻った。明日の総攻撃を前に、兵士たちに余計な動揺を与えるわけにはいかない。","source_cn":"阿尔娜没有理会下跪乞怜的守卫，她返回战线，下令封锁领主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA6C6A2CCDB3B5A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:80:1064404047:0":{"text":"そして、総攻撃の日が訪れた……","source_cn":"总攻之日很快到来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AE3B2855C5F428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064404048:0":{"text":"魔物の軍勢が次々と集結するも、すぐに攻め込んでくる気配はなかった。ほどなくして、カタストロフ総帥に引きずり出されて現れたのは――領主のスノーだった。","source_cn":"魔物军队不断集结，但似乎并不急于进攻。不久后，恶魔统领...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9840472A6AA4316E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064404049:0":{"text":"ふ……見ろ。これが貴様らの愚かな忠義の果てだ！","source_cn":"呵……看看你们所愚忠之人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBEB579D861B5A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064404050:0":{"text":"よ……余はそなたらの領主だ！直ちに門を開けよ！彼らは約束した。開城すれば危害は加えないと！","source_cn":"我、我是你们的领主！我命令你们，打开城门！它们答应了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2B5C1D4DE32D857","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064404051:0":{"text":"あれは……スノー様！？サバス城にいるはずじゃ……"